@* Launcher for the slide-over assistant (_AiDrawer). Bootstrap's offcanvas toggle does the
   opening — the only behaviour left in site.js (initFloatingAvatar) is the scroll-hide, which
   keeps the fixed bubble from permanently covering whatever lands under it.
   The old hover card is gone: its single "Open Chat" link now lives in the drawer header. *@
<div id="floatingAvatar">
    <button type="button" class="avatar-bubble" data-bs-toggle="offcanvas" data-bs-target="#aiDrawer"
            aria-controls="aiDrawer" title="@Loc.T("AI Assistant")" aria-label="@Loc.T("AI Assistant")">
        <i class="bi bi-robot fs-4" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </button>
</div>
